# BIT-1's Follow: the first song's lead is track 4 and four tracks follow it. ARP twice for the page; a
# following track won't take a written note; EDIT a new take; SEL + EDIT writes the takes into their cells
tap ARP
tap ARP
expect view 8
expect par12 4
expect par26 1
expect par38 1
expect par50 3
# playing (from power-on): the followers play their takes
wait 5000
expect playing 1
expect notes >30
shot follow_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
# REC on, track 1 follows: a key writes nothing there
tap REC
tapkey w0
expect cell0.0.0 0
tap REC
# EDIT: a new take
tap EDIT
expect par14 1
expect dirty 1
# SEL + EDIT: the takes written in (the drums' kick on the one), the tracks back to their own
press SEL
tap EDIT
release SEL
expect par26 0
expect par38 0
expect par50 0
expect cell0.0.0 36
shot follow_written.png
# the lead off: the page still shows, nothing follows
spin K1 -4
expect par12 0
